WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:11,130
We still have to chase. We have no choice but to go that way. Huang Tianwei, don’t run away.

2
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:28,400
There are so many of us that you can't run away. Qi Wei is here. He's in the water. Why don't you try this hard?

3
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,360
We all forced him into the river

4
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:32,600
I don’t know if anything will happen to him as a girl.

5
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:35,080
Who wants to force him?

6
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,440
It won't hurt him if he gets caught

7
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:38,360
Who knew he would work so hard to get into the water at night?

8
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:40,160
Will you get sick if your clothes are not dried in time?

9
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:41,600
You think I'm a scumbag

10
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:42,720
Isn’t it just for the credits?

11
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:43,880
Aren’t I doing it for the credits?

12
00:00:49,270 --> 00:00:50,430
Teacher Cao’s method

13
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,150
I don’t want to chase a girl either

14
00:00:52,390 --> 00:00:53,470
Mainly, I still haven’t caught up.
